Philippe Gerum wrote:
 > 	[arm]
 > 	* Add support for Atmel AT91-based platforms.

The patches for AT91 are missing an important piece (the configuration
of the interrupt controller priorities). Here are the correct
ones. Sorry about this.

-- 


					    Gilles Chanteperdrix.

